WEBVTT

00:00:01.041 --> 00:00:10.241
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.051 --> 00:00:21.251
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.831 --> 00:00:30.731
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.231 --> 00:00:37.191
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.311 --> 00:00:39.241
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.571 --> 00:00:43.531
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.281 --> 00:00:48.411
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.821 --> 00:00:52.621
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.291 --> 00:01:00.291
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.631 --> 00:01:08.971
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.841 --> 00:01:15.971
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.181 --> 00:01:21.451
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.551 --> 00:01:24.611
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:46.981 --> 00:01:51.281
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:55.171
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:57.911
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:59.791 --> 00:02:03.821
Illusionist Caldina created
an illusion of Princess Emeraude...

00:02:03.931 --> 00:02:06.521
...and made her attack
Hikaru and company.

00:02:08.831 --> 00:02:13.271
However, Umi was able to find
her way through the ingenious trap.

00:02:14.301 --> 00:02:18.741
She was able to wound Caldina and
convince Ascot to change his ways.

00:02:18.841 --> 00:02:24.541
And so, they continue on their journey
to acquire the second Rune-God.

00:02:24.881 --> 00:02:27.141
Is that all right with you?

00:02:28.851 --> 00:02:30.111
I'm sorry.

00:02:31.051 --> 00:02:37.011
The Most Valuable Thing in This World

00:02:45.931 --> 00:02:47.031
Really...

00:02:47.401 --> 00:02:51.131
Those little girls are takin'
advantage of everyone.

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:54.471
I gotta finish 'em...
Finish 'em for good.

00:02:54.581 --> 00:02:56.871
I guess this...

00:02:57.251 --> 00:02:58.801
...ultra-pretty...

00:02:58.951 --> 00:03:00.611
...and nice-bodied...

00:03:01.521 --> 00:03:04.541
...Caldina will take care of 'em now.

00:03:06.321 --> 00:03:08.411
Hey, let's stop now!

00:03:09.221 --> 00:03:10.321
Caldina!

00:03:10.561 --> 00:03:12.121
I don't care anymore!

00:03:12.231 --> 00:03:14.661
I don't care about the Magic Knights!

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:16.201
Come on, Ascot.

00:03:16.301 --> 00:03:20.701
If we get rid of the Magic Knights,
Zagato will pay us lotsa money.

00:03:20.801 --> 00:03:22.041
As long as we got the cash...

00:03:22.041 --> 00:03:23.211
As long as we got the cash...
I don't want money.

00:03:23.211 --> 00:03:24.401
I don't want money.

00:03:24.511 --> 00:03:27.501
Yeah! Let's leave
those Magic Knights and...

00:03:27.641 --> 00:03:28.631
Ascot!

00:03:30.181 --> 00:03:33.551
I think you're very cute, Ascot.

00:03:34.721 --> 00:03:37.451
I feel like you're
my little brother for real.

00:03:37.551 --> 00:03:38.711
Caldina...

00:03:39.551 --> 00:03:40.541
Money!

00:03:40.661 --> 00:03:46.151
If we had cash, we could live together
happily for the rest of our lives.

00:03:58.541 --> 00:03:59.631
Caldina!

00:03:59.811 --> 00:04:02.611
I'll make sure
I get those Magic Knights!

00:04:03.181 --> 00:04:04.981
This time for sure!

00:04:05.751 --> 00:04:06.981
This time...

00:04:11.321 --> 00:04:12.511
Caldina...

00:04:22.201 --> 00:04:24.691
Mokona, how much
farther must we walk...

00:04:24.801 --> 00:04:27.231
...till we reach
that floating mountain?

00:04:30.871 --> 00:04:32.311
What is that?

00:04:32.541 --> 00:04:34.011
A mountain, correct?

00:04:34.111 --> 00:04:36.871
And how many more
do we have to cross?

00:04:40.751 --> 00:04:42.011
Four more?

00:04:43.721 --> 00:04:45.241
So it seems.

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:47.321
What? Four more?

00:04:48.561 --> 00:04:50.651
What are you happy about, Mokona?

00:04:51.061 --> 00:04:53.431
Something's always
bugged me about you...

00:04:53.531 --> 00:04:56.291
That smile that lacks
any sign of tension!

00:04:57.301 --> 00:05:00.131
And why do you always
vanish when there's a battle?

00:05:00.241 --> 00:05:03.571
You'd better not be having fun
watching us get into trouble!

00:05:04.471 --> 00:05:05.731
W-What?

00:05:10.411 --> 00:05:11.571
Mokona!

00:05:12.911 --> 00:05:17.681
Mokona, I'm gonna find out what's
inside that fluffy body of yours!

00:05:20.421 --> 00:05:21.481
Wait!

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:23.211
You!

00:05:23.331 --> 00:05:24.291
Mokona!

00:05:24.861 --> 00:05:27.161
Just you wait!

00:05:28.431 --> 00:05:32.631
I wonder if we will really
be able to reach that boulder?

00:05:34.701 --> 00:05:37.501
To that boulder where
the second Rune-God sleeps...

00:05:38.211 --> 00:05:40.371
We will if we keep on walking!

00:05:40.481 --> 00:05:42.811
We have to hurry and
get the second Rune-God.

00:05:42.911 --> 00:05:45.141
Fuu, Umi, let's go!

00:05:47.651 --> 00:05:49.621
Just hold on a sec!

00:05:50.021 --> 00:05:51.881
I thought I heard something.

00:05:51.991 --> 00:05:54.081
I think it was a woman's voice.

00:05:57.931 --> 00:05:59.021
The trees?

00:06:00.761 --> 00:06:02.201
Bats!

00:06:04.401 --> 00:06:08.391
I have no intent of deepening
my relationship with Mr. Bat!

00:06:09.641 --> 00:06:10.761
Fuu!

00:06:12.471 --> 00:06:14.741
It's dangerous to be alone! Wait!

00:06:14.841 --> 00:06:16.781
Don't go that way! Fuu!

00:06:20.581 --> 00:06:21.551
Who are you?

00:06:21.551 --> 00:06:22.551
Who are you?
Is that any way to greet...

00:06:22.551 --> 00:06:23.851
Is that any way to greet...

00:06:23.951 --> 00:06:29.081
...such a beautiful
and wonderful gal like me?

00:06:29.291 --> 00:06:31.381
What's this "who are you" stuff?

00:06:32.731 --> 00:06:35.561
W-Wait a sec...
Isn't that the Osaka dialect?

00:06:35.631 --> 00:06:36.891
Y-Yeah...

00:06:37.231 --> 00:06:40.691
Does Cephiro's linguistic
background contain this dialect?

00:06:40.801 --> 00:06:43.401
Or is there another Osaka here?

00:06:43.741 --> 00:06:46.541
I'm Caldina.
What're your names, missies?

00:06:47.011 --> 00:06:49.911
Why should I introduce
myself now of all times?

00:06:50.011 --> 00:06:51.771
I'm Hikaru Shidou.

00:06:52.351 --> 00:06:53.551
I'm Umi Ryuuzaki!

00:06:53.551 --> 00:06:54.881
I'm Umi Ryuuzaki!
Hikaru Shidou... Umi Ryuuzaki...

00:06:54.881 --> 00:06:56.321
Hikaru Shidou... Umi Ryuuzaki...

00:06:56.421 --> 00:06:58.411
Those sure are weird names.

00:06:58.521 --> 00:07:00.111
Well, excuse me!

00:07:00.221 --> 00:07:02.711
We have to go find Fuu right now!

00:07:02.821 --> 00:07:05.591
We don't have time
to deal with Osaka weirdos!

00:07:05.691 --> 00:07:06.681
Oh?

00:07:08.401 --> 00:07:11.091
So the third missy's
name is Fuu, huh?

00:07:11.201 --> 00:07:13.831
If Fuu gets lost, it's your fault.

00:07:13.941 --> 00:07:16.061
You don't have to worry about her.

00:07:16.171 --> 00:07:18.301
And how do you know that?

00:07:18.871 --> 00:07:21.141
Oh, it's all right I tell ya.

00:07:21.241 --> 00:07:23.731
I'll make sure
you get to see her soon.

00:07:24.681 --> 00:07:26.151
Thank you.

00:07:26.251 --> 00:07:30.081
Well, I feel bad if you
honestly thank me like that...

00:07:30.691 --> 00:07:32.381
...'coz I've got...

00:07:35.691 --> 00:07:37.681
...ties to Zagato.

00:07:38.731 --> 00:07:39.821
Zagato?

00:07:52.311 --> 00:07:53.431
Umi...

00:07:53.541 --> 00:07:54.911
D-Don't...

00:07:55.781 --> 00:07:57.571
...listen to the bells...

00:08:07.191 --> 00:08:08.551
Caldina!

00:08:08.661 --> 00:08:09.881
Caldina!

00:08:19.231 --> 00:08:20.791
Hey! Go away!

00:08:20.901 --> 00:08:22.341
Shoo! Shoo!

00:08:22.541 --> 00:08:24.401
Go away already!

00:08:24.511 --> 00:08:26.271
Jeez! There!

00:08:27.741 --> 00:08:28.941
Take that!

00:08:29.141 --> 00:08:30.871
And that! And that!

00:08:34.981 --> 00:08:36.421
Shoo! Shoo!

00:08:42.921 --> 00:08:44.551
A Magic Knight...

00:08:57.271 --> 00:08:58.711
Ms. Hikaru!

00:08:59.071 --> 00:09:00.511
Ms. Umi!

00:09:02.841 --> 00:09:05.281
Ms. Hikaru! Ms. Umi!

00:09:37.611 --> 00:09:39.641
Ms. Hikaru... Ms. Umi...

00:09:39.751 --> 00:09:41.181
Thank goodness.

00:09:43.151 --> 00:09:46.781
It is dangerous in this
wind tunnel. We must hurry out!

00:10:06.311 --> 00:10:07.171
Why?

00:10:14.581 --> 00:10:15.841
Ms. Umi...

00:10:16.181 --> 00:10:17.211
Why?

00:10:19.821 --> 00:10:21.291
Ms. Hikaru!

00:10:23.861 --> 00:10:27.891
Ms. Hikaru, Ms. Umi, why...
Why are you doing this to me?

00:10:33.171 --> 00:10:34.261
Ms. Umi!

00:10:34.871 --> 00:10:36.031
Ms. Hikaru!

00:10:52.921 --> 00:10:56.411
You're really good
at runnin' away, missy.

00:10:57.591 --> 00:11:01.791
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:03.161 --> 00:11:06.161
You're really good
at runnin' away, missy.

00:11:06.501 --> 00:11:09.771
It looks like I gotta
step in to finish the job.

00:11:10.971 --> 00:11:12.771
I'm Caldina, a dancer.

00:11:12.871 --> 00:11:15.311
But I can do stuff like this too.

00:11:23.121 --> 00:11:26.711
Those bats... Then you also
did the same thing to them?

00:11:26.821 --> 00:11:28.051
Bingo.

00:11:28.461 --> 00:11:32.021
Both of 'em now faithfully
follow my every order.

00:11:33.861 --> 00:11:37.161
That means you are
one of Zagato's associates.

00:11:42.871 --> 00:11:44.061
Actually...

00:11:45.241 --> 00:11:47.501
If I defeat you Magic Knights...

00:11:49.741 --> 00:11:52.271
...I get tons of money!

00:11:54.921 --> 00:11:56.471
M-Money...

00:11:57.121 --> 00:11:59.681
I'm a professional
dancer and illusionist...

00:11:59.851 --> 00:12:02.881
...who works as hard as I'm paid.

00:12:03.291 --> 00:12:07.661
We've got no ties nor grudges,
but I'll have you dead, polite missy.

00:12:15.601 --> 00:12:16.731
Ms. Umi!

00:12:17.741 --> 00:12:18.831
Ms. Hikaru!

00:12:22.581 --> 00:12:23.701
Ms. Umi!

00:12:24.811 --> 00:12:25.901
Ms. Hikaru!

00:12:26.751 --> 00:12:27.651
Why?

00:12:28.351 --> 00:12:31.081
Why aren't ya drawin'
your sword and fightin' back?

00:12:31.821 --> 00:12:34.621
Both Ms. Hikaru and
Ms. Umi are my friends!

00:12:34.721 --> 00:12:37.951
Dear comrades since
we three are alone in Cephiro!

00:12:38.061 --> 00:12:40.721
I cannot bring myself to harm them!

00:12:40.831 --> 00:12:44.791
Such pretense... Can you still not
draw your sword even with this?

00:12:56.341 --> 00:12:57.741
What should I...

00:12:57.851 --> 00:12:59.611
What should I do?

00:13:08.291 --> 00:13:11.921
Here in Cephiro, everything
is determined by one's heart.

00:13:13.461 --> 00:13:14.621
Mr. Clef!

00:13:15.001 --> 00:13:18.331
Believe in your strength
that changes the future.

00:13:19.071 --> 00:13:23.901
Remember all those that you trusted
from the bottom of your heart.

00:13:24.771 --> 00:13:26.741
Shake away your doubts, Fuu.

00:13:29.881 --> 00:13:32.211
Strength of the believing heart...

00:13:35.081 --> 00:13:37.021
Winds of Admonishment!

00:13:52.401 --> 00:13:57.271
Bravo. Nothing less from the missy
that woulda become a Magic Knight.

00:13:57.371 --> 00:13:59.101
I'm impressed.

00:14:00.211 --> 00:14:02.971
But it was a mistake
to draw your sword!

00:14:06.981 --> 00:14:10.351
It's a little lonely without
many people in the audience.

00:14:10.451 --> 00:14:11.711
Oh, well.

00:14:11.821 --> 00:14:14.291
All right, on to plan B.

00:14:23.731 --> 00:14:25.161
What is this?

00:14:26.001 --> 00:14:27.591
M-My body is...

00:14:31.541 --> 00:14:33.801
My body is moving on its own!

00:14:38.251 --> 00:14:42.681
Resistance is futile.
Nobody can escape from my illusions.

00:14:56.801 --> 00:14:58.061
Ms. Hikaru!

00:15:03.671 --> 00:15:04.801
Ms. Umi!

00:15:04.911 --> 00:15:08.871
I'm so glad that you move
just like how I want you to.

00:15:09.511 --> 00:15:12.811
You got some impressive title,
legendary Magic Knight.

00:15:13.351 --> 00:15:16.281
But you girls are
just cute little missies.

00:15:16.821 --> 00:15:18.221
This should do!

00:15:21.991 --> 00:15:23.921
Ms. Umi! Ms. Hikaru!

00:15:24.031 --> 00:15:25.461
Please wake up!

00:15:27.631 --> 00:15:31.391
At this rate, with the next blow,
I might seriously hurt...

00:15:32.371 --> 00:15:34.491
No, I might kill you!

00:15:34.601 --> 00:15:36.191
Well, goodbye.

00:15:41.041 --> 00:15:42.131
Ascot!

00:15:42.411 --> 00:15:46.571
The Magic Knights aren't bad people!
Let's forget about killing them!

00:15:46.911 --> 00:15:49.681
Don't get in my way!
Just shut up and watch!

00:15:54.391 --> 00:15:56.621
He is not one of your friends?

00:15:56.961 --> 00:16:00.361
Friend?
Ascot is more like my little brother.

00:16:00.831 --> 00:16:04.561
If you care about him that much,
why do such a horrible thing?

00:16:04.671 --> 00:16:06.761
Ascot's still a little kid.

00:16:06.871 --> 00:16:09.931
I don't wanna stain his
little hands with blood...

00:16:10.201 --> 00:16:12.471
...with the blood
of you Magic Knights.

00:16:13.111 --> 00:16:16.041
Well, let's end all this now, shall we?

00:16:19.481 --> 00:16:22.571
So, I'll have you
finish 'em off with magic!

00:16:26.651 --> 00:16:28.621
Ms. Hikaru and Ms. Umi...

00:16:30.021 --> 00:16:31.721
...are my dear...

00:16:38.531 --> 00:16:39.791
My dear...

00:16:40.201 --> 00:16:41.131
...friends!

00:16:42.271 --> 00:16:44.931
I'll make sure you
follow them real quick, missy!

00:16:55.221 --> 00:16:56.311
Strength...

00:16:56.551 --> 00:16:58.881
Strength of the believing heart...

00:16:59.191 --> 00:17:00.351
The future...

00:17:00.451 --> 00:17:02.181
Decides the future!

00:17:02.891 --> 00:17:04.321
Now kill them.

00:17:09.361 --> 00:17:10.661
Emerald...

00:17:10.731 --> 00:17:11.601
No way!

00:17:11.671 --> 00:17:13.291
...Typhoon!

00:17:49.301 --> 00:17:50.331
Why?

00:17:50.441 --> 00:17:53.241
I don't get it! I just don't get it!

00:17:53.341 --> 00:17:58.301
Why did I, Cephiro's best illusionist,
lose to little missies like you?

00:17:58.411 --> 00:18:00.611
You were indeed stronger than me.

00:18:00.721 --> 00:18:01.701
Then why?

00:18:02.021 --> 00:18:05.881
You said that you were
going to kill us for money.

00:18:06.551 --> 00:18:11.421
But were you willing to risk
your own dear life for that purpose?

00:18:11.791 --> 00:18:15.191
Of course not.
My life is for me alone.

00:18:15.801 --> 00:18:20.361
Apparently, I feel I can risk my life
for Ms. Hikaru and Ms. Umi's sakes.

00:18:21.071 --> 00:18:24.831
When I injured both of them
while under your illusion...

00:18:25.111 --> 00:18:28.541
...I felt that I could use all
of my strength to save them.

00:18:29.181 --> 00:18:32.151
That I could risk my life
to save my dear friends.

00:18:32.251 --> 00:18:33.511
Risk your life?

00:18:33.511 --> 00:18:34.381
Risk your life?
Yes.

00:18:34.481 --> 00:18:36.751
Are you guys old friends?

00:18:37.491 --> 00:18:43.421
No, I did not meet them until we were
summoned to Cephiro from Tokyo.

00:18:43.761 --> 00:18:44.991
Then how...

00:18:45.091 --> 00:18:49.151
How can ya risk your life for folks
you've known such a short time?

00:18:49.261 --> 00:18:51.701
Time does not matter to the heart.

00:18:52.171 --> 00:18:54.761
No matter how short
our time together...

00:18:54.871 --> 00:18:58.201
Even if there are many things
I do not know about them...

00:18:58.311 --> 00:19:01.931
I decided to keep
fighting on with both of them.

00:19:02.581 --> 00:19:04.941
Mr. Ascot is like myself.

00:19:05.351 --> 00:19:07.611
He tried his best to save you.

00:19:09.951 --> 00:19:11.041
Ascot!

00:19:11.351 --> 00:19:14.521
You're such an idiot...

00:19:19.591 --> 00:19:22.431
Let's stop now, Caldina!
The Magic Knights...

00:19:23.561 --> 00:19:27.401
He risked his life
to save us and Ms. Caldina.

00:19:32.941 --> 00:19:35.171
I can't win against ya, missy.

00:19:35.581 --> 00:19:36.841
Ms. Caldina?

00:19:37.811 --> 00:19:42.581
I dunno if it's good or bad to have
somethin' you can risk your life for.

00:19:43.421 --> 00:19:45.411
But I thought it was cool.

00:19:45.521 --> 00:19:48.681
At least, ya stirred
my soul more than Zagato...

00:19:48.791 --> 00:19:52.231
...whose reasons for all
this commotion are unknown.

00:19:52.931 --> 00:19:55.231
The objective of High Priest Zagato...

00:19:55.331 --> 00:19:57.991
...is not to control all of Cephiro?

00:19:59.131 --> 00:20:02.191
Princess Emeraude can't
use her powers of prayer now.

00:20:02.301 --> 00:20:07.371
Controlling an unstable land full
of monsters like this is pointless.

00:20:07.741 --> 00:20:11.611
I asked him too. "Why not have
Princess Emeraude keep prayin'...

00:20:11.711 --> 00:20:16.511
...but hand all power to you if it
keeps Cephiro from fallin' into ruin?"

00:20:16.851 --> 00:20:19.081
But he just laughed and said...

00:20:19.191 --> 00:20:21.881
..."I have something
more valuable than Cephiro."

00:20:21.991 --> 00:20:25.321
Something more valuable
than Cephiro? What is that?

00:20:25.431 --> 00:20:28.861
He didn't give me
any more answers after that.

00:20:29.601 --> 00:20:33.031
I'm sure he has some
reason deep down in his heart.

00:20:35.841 --> 00:20:37.701
Hey, let's get goin' now.

00:20:37.811 --> 00:20:39.601
B-Back to the castle?

00:20:40.741 --> 00:20:43.401
I don't wanna
go back there ever again.

00:20:43.511 --> 00:20:45.481
Really? I'm so glad!

00:20:46.111 --> 00:20:47.081
Fuu!

00:20:47.921 --> 00:20:49.221
She's one of Zagato's...

00:20:49.221 --> 00:20:50.381
She's one of Zagato's...
Ms. Hikaru.

00:20:51.291 --> 00:20:53.251
She is no longer our enemy.

00:20:53.721 --> 00:20:55.921
Fuu... But...

00:20:56.291 --> 00:20:57.721
It's okay, Hikaru.

00:20:57.831 --> 00:21:01.121
She's someone Ascot would
sacrifice himself to protect.

00:21:01.231 --> 00:21:02.821
Right, Ascot?

00:21:03.661 --> 00:21:05.101
Y-Yeah.

00:21:05.201 --> 00:21:08.661
We can't help
y'all out, but do your best.

00:21:10.541 --> 00:21:12.631
Zagato is very powerful.

00:21:14.811 --> 00:21:16.141
Let's go, Ascot.

00:21:16.241 --> 00:21:17.271
I-I...

00:21:18.181 --> 00:21:20.511
I won't say goodbye, Ascot.

00:21:20.811 --> 00:21:22.711
After all, we are friends.

00:21:23.181 --> 00:21:25.171
Yeah, we'll meet again soon.

00:21:25.821 --> 00:21:26.791
Yeah!

00:21:34.461 --> 00:21:36.551
I can't see them anymore.

00:21:37.301 --> 00:21:38.291
Mokona!

00:21:38.901 --> 00:21:40.871
Thank you, Sir Mokona.

00:21:41.771 --> 00:21:45.761
How does disappearing during
a battle deserve thanks, Fuu?

00:21:46.471 --> 00:21:49.911
Mokona must've given you
something, and you're not telling us!

00:21:50.641 --> 00:21:52.741
I think Mokona's disagreeing.

00:21:58.021 --> 00:21:59.821
More than Cephiro...

00:22:05.891 --> 00:22:08.861
Something more
valuable than Cephiro...

00:22:26.011 --> 00:22:30.421
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:31.991 --> 00:22:37.581
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:39.031 --> 00:22:44.591
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:45.331 --> 00:22:49.171
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:51.471 --> 00:22:54.641
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:54.841 --> 00:22:57.281
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:58.381 --> 00:23:02.181
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:03.221 --> 00:23:09.851
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:10.591 --> 00:23:15.861
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:16.231 --> 00:23:23.031
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:23.541 --> 00:23:28.981
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:44.261 --> 00:23:46.061
I'm Hikaru Shidou.

00:23:46.661 --> 00:23:50.601
Umi and Fuu have been
abducted by an unknown monster.

00:23:50.801 --> 00:23:53.101
I was left all alone.

00:23:53.431 --> 00:23:56.871
I thought about communicating
with Clef and called for him...

00:23:56.971 --> 00:23:59.911
...but not even Clef
knows what the monster is.

00:24:00.011 --> 00:24:03.241
Where in the world
were they taken away?

00:24:04.411 --> 00:24:06.381
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:06.711 --> 00:24:08.621
Hikaru, Umi, and Fuu's Unyielding Wish

00:24:08.621 --> 00:24:10.421
Hikaru, Umi, and Fuu's Unyielding Wish
Hikaru, Umi, and Fuu's Unyielding Wish.

00:24:10.421 --> 00:24:12.591
Hikaru, Umi, and Fuu's Unyielding Wish
You have to watch it!

00:24:12.591 --> 00:24:20.521
Who is it today?

00:24:20.631 --> 00:24:22.491
Today, it is Ms. Umi!

00:24:22.601 --> 00:24:23.131
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:23.131 --> 00:24:25.431
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:25.431 --> 00:24:27.431
Look forward to the next episode!
I'll see you later!

00:24:27.431 --> 00:24:28.561
Look forward to the next episode!
